    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293">

                <pb facs="0345" n="229" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg229"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1194.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sullivan to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>
                            <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-30T19:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 30, 1914, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Revolutionists by resistance have caused closing of Puerto Plata customhouses and
                    interference with American Government’s rights under the convention, which
                    provides that we may protest the same. I earnestly recommend Department’s
                    serious consideration of this phase of present insurrection.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
